### Create an order (REST trigger)
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1.23,
    "productCount": 2
}

### Create an order (use case injected into a regular controller)
POST localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1.23,
    "productCount": 2
}

### Search orders (query parameters bind by name)
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?minAmount=1&limit=10

### Find an order (replace the id)
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update an order (replace the id; requires X-User-Id, checked by the requireUser filter)
PUT localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-User-Id: alice
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 4.56,
    "productCount": 3
}

### Cancel an order (replace the id)
DELETE localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Generate an id (group `public`: no filters)
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/generate-id
